  maxHealth: 100
  contactDamage: 1
  scoreReward: 1500
  description: Green curtains of grave-light, swaying as they fall. The Lich conducts
    them like a choir, and below half health the phalanx begins to march.
  tactics: 'Sine curtains (violet snaking walls) with fast aimed spit underneath.
    The curtains breathe - their gaps slide in waves; move WITH the wave, not against
    it. Requiem (below half) adds a snaking phalanx wall: keep to the screen''s lower
    third and thread the oscillation.'
